# brace-expansion DoS (CVE-2026-14257 and its mitigation-bypass follow-up)
# is fixed, not ignored — see the root package.json `overrides` entry
# pinning the minimatch@3.1.5 instance to brace-expansion@1.1.18 (same 1.x
# API, no rewrite needed). No entry required here anymore.
